  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nON RECRUIT / ALTAR CREATION:
    gain one seeded random run bonus: +6% team damage, +6% team movement speed, +0.06
    Luck, or +0.12 hero armor. Once per acquisition.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam
    / Collision damage: +1\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA
    bridge weaver who tightened a safety web until nobody could move. They cut it
    and helped rebuild the road. Each new knot has a release reachable by the person
    it supports.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero
    for 1.5 HP before healing modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents
    count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied
    by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately
    at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: oddity, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two
    equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
